{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01950",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 4.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.01,
      "end_seconds": 10.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.83,
      "end_seconds": 19.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Doctor, it's shaky hands. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.44,
      "end_seconds": 26.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.07,
      "end_seconds": 32.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "For two months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.4,
      "end_seconds": 42.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.1,
      "end_seconds": 59.48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.38,
      "text": "It feels severe to me. It happens on and off. And drinking most nights, too. There's poor sleep as well. Right, about poor sleep, it feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.06,
      "end_seconds": 65.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Have you had shaky hands before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 74.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.81,
      "end_seconds": 82.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.59,
      "end_seconds": 95.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.74,
      "end_seconds": 116.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 114 over 78, pulse is 67 beats a minute, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.92,
      "end_seconds": 122.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.66,
      "end_seconds": 125.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.22,
      "end_seconds": 149.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Your liver edge is felt slightly below the ribs and there is a fine tremor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.85,
      "end_seconds": 154.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.22,
      "end_seconds": 167.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Have you had any vomiting blood or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.07,
      "end_seconds": 171.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I haven't had vomiting blood or confusion, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.38,
      "end_seconds": 177.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Have you had any yellow eyes or black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.82,
      "end_seconds": 183.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "No yellow eyes or black stools, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.18,
      "end_seconds": 192.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.28,
      "end_seconds": 194.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.92,
      "end_seconds": 211.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.19,
      "end_seconds": 225.69,
      "duration_seconds": 12.5,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.22,
      "end_seconds": 229.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Okay, tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.34,
      "end_seconds": 234.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Telmisartan, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.47,
      "end_seconds": 238.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.74,
      "end_seconds": 246.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "40 milligrams. Apixaban, twice a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.06,
      "end_seconds": 250.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.31,
      "end_seconds": 259.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "5 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.33,
      "end_seconds": 262.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.63,
      "end_seconds": 271.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.79,
      "end_seconds": 274.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.56,
      "end_seconds": 281.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.49,
      "end_seconds": 293.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Yes, high blood pressure and an irregular heartbeat are known to us, good to have that clear. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.47,
      "end_seconds": 298.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.58,
      "end_seconds": 330.94,
      "duration_seconds": 19.36,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it points towards harmful alcohol use with liver strain. Another possibility is fatty liver. Let's get liver blood tests, for alcohol use. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.21,
      "end_seconds": 333.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.49,
      "end_seconds": 339.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "We should do an ultrasound of the liver for hepatomegaly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.23,
      "end_seconds": 344.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.87,
      "end_seconds": 355.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "We should do a blood count for alcohol use. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.79,
      "end_seconds": 364.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.14,
      "end_seconds": 394.7,
      "duration_seconds": 28.56,
      "text": "For this, thiamine, 100 milligrams, three times a day, long term. It's for alcohol-related nutritional deficiency. Cut down gradually and do not stop suddenly on your own if you drink heavily. I'd like you to see the alcohol support service as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.37,
      "end_seconds": 398.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.35,
      "end_seconds": 403.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Book a review after the tests."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 404.3,
      "end_seconds": 407.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.59,
      "end_seconds": 412.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.55,
      "end_seconds": 416.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}